# Registry snapshots and run artefacts: produced by the scripts, never committed.
# `data/*` and not `data/`: git never looks inside an excluded directory, so the
# re-include below would silently lose the one file in data/ that is published.
data/*
!data/external/
data/external/*
!data/external/EXTERNAL.md
output/
